{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_title", "source_sha256": "86eccdd39692d13efb2055cb2e5278096a2e41d74bcea129b8abc5f6b870d6a8", "ja": "それは何の変哲もない", "zh": "那只是平平无奇的", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ac91ef3597815a8f68fb968f7816c0a79f7fce0a2c9b851e771187c693a9d5d8", "ja": "公演前、ソワソワしている麗花。もしや彼氏\nができた？と心配するメンバー。だが麗花と\n待ち合わせをしていたのは小さな男の子だっ\nた。麗花は公演で、男の子や来てくれた人達\nみんなを、笑顔にしたいと願う。", "zh": "公演前，丽花显得有些坐立不安。大家不禁\n担心她是不是交了男朋友？然而与丽花碰面\n的却是一个小男孩。丽花希望能在公演中，\n让那个男孩以及所有到场的观众都绽放笑颜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d27393022ef599d09849e9512f40134b087c34dabe766115a1e7c22f20b09c16", "ja": "（後をつけるのは気が引けるけど、\nプロデューサーとしては事態を把握すべきだしな……）", "zh": "（虽然跟踪别人总觉得不太好，但作为制作人，还是应该掌握情况才行……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d184d99fe144ab42e312800ce006d2f19ba7db5333c96c3ac3801cbce5e27b56", "ja": "（麗花が向かっている方向からすると……\n待ち合わせ場所は、公園みたいだな）", "zh": "（从丽花前往的方向来看……\n见面的地方好像是公园）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "dcf937d590ecde242fabf8439977ed4c040f1d156d23976eb67272e8e459fb5f", "ja": "ふんふんふーん♪　ふふっ♪", "zh": "哼哼哼♪　呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "f0739ef568b26376182e507cbd47e2864918519298f92f6847e9cabcd70d5c75", "ja": "麗花さん、鼻歌を歌ったり、\nスキップしたりしてるね。なんだか楽しそう。", "zh": "丽花姐又哼着歌，又蹦蹦跳跳的。看起来好像很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "e7828a6df383c2e3c8cb448316554bfde98778eab64a87b6e7bd2834e6041dc5", "ja": "あの様子……やっぱり、\n彼氏さんを待っているんでしょうか？", "zh": "看那个样子……果然是在等男朋友吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1005_049mom", "source_sha256": "b513b15f6cac95a6df4c44cfdf5beaec9f8edb2103b4cf8164d45cef17eb4cd5", "ja": "楽しそうなのは、歌織さんとお兄ちゃんもじゃない？", "zh": "开心的不还有歌织姐和哥哥吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "563d927e37e968b70f41184cf68b39205f82971227f091ed6f3191e4dcdc8f90", "ja": "だな。プライバシーが～って注意してた割には、\nなかなか熱心じゃないか。", "zh": "是啊。明明还提醒过要注意隐私什么的，没想到还挺热心嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d96914acd4e36fe77d672df9d79c2c293d69b950b1193fa2f5ec6886b1325aeb", "ja": "いや、麗花の事が心配なのは本当で……。", "zh": "不是，我是真的很担心丽花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "879d172bba2ac5ce3b95306c038d6053fcbb12e8201f0bc59c837e699c1483a6", "ja": "あっ、見てください！　麗花ちゃんが\n公園の入口に向かって手を振ってますよ。相手は……。", "zh": "啊，快看！丽花正在朝公园入口挥手呢。对方是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "c11dcce9eb29f6290a615a951ffa0881b84d0d803bd708a7ebb38eeadd629829", "ja": "あれ？　小学生くらいの子ですね。", "zh": "咦？是个小学生年纪的孩子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "4b2679e1797ae7a8fb1ee4256176bb0ee05be15947cba79795997fe95295dd3b", "ja": "まさか、あれが恋人か……？", "zh": "难道，那就是恋人吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "94137e18d9d4798a501df2d17b10e4a27398c22b1b1734e279d15a854ec7f70b", "ja": "恋人って、誰の？", "zh": "恋人是指谁的恋人呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "5690ea616a83e2c571f09f90875319cdbb16dfe2cc26b2085788dd952eb83de8", "ja": "決まってるだろ、レイの……うわっ、レイ！？", "zh": "当然是丽花的……哇，丽花！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1013_p", "source_sha256": "627355c6b4041a2863d7e0b93947566cea727674d02c3d6d8fd4cc01a15e385f", "ja": "麗花、いつの間に……。", "zh": "丽花，你什么时候来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "00cdfbd584e787030746824115949998cd5f6329f3b44972a0811235275110c8", "ja": "話し声が聞こえるな～と思って振り返ったら、\nみんなの姿が見えたので♪", "zh": "我听到说话声，回头一看，\n就看到大家了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1015_048rei", "source_sha256": "76b438f862d97a8afc26141f4b44b931442c6a67c98d93224b9bcec092a1b623", "ja": "もしかして、かくれんぼですか？\nいいないいな～、私たちも混ぜてください♪", "zh": "难道说，你们在捉迷藏吗？\n真好呀真好呀～，也让我们加入吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "bc0b2ca7302c476a64c126517d7c30d3fed8b3fa4ca28a7d29388d273006f3e1", "ja": "いいえ。その、かくれんぼではなくて……。\nあの、麗花ちゃん。そちらの男の子は？", "zh": "不是。那个，不是在玩捉迷藏……  \n请问，丽花。那边的男孩子是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "49435471c9154f3fc6ac0f1358008108d0a9d16e71507a2925f2e23c23699910", "ja": "この子は、ずばり、私のお友達です！\nケンジ君っていうんですよ♪", "zh": "这个孩子嘛，毫无疑问是我的朋友！\n他叫健二哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1019_p", "source_sha256": "94034ab4c07ce3bc7be2be0c9544e8c6d3b0eb6ae2a0eb5f790c8429fc1dcf2b", "ja": "お友達？", "zh": "朋友？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "3d7a58bfec5bccb25aaf682a7c5bd24cc40c10069d96cb4edd91fb7d2939b740", "ja": "はい♪　出会いは、この公園でした。\nお散歩中、そこのブランコにこの子が座ってて。", "zh": "是的♪　我们就是在这个公园相遇的。\n散步的时候，这孩子正坐在那边的秋千上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "132b91cd773a61dfe2995a3b2acbbdf01b03a5f570a4f58109c3724106807203", "ja": "私も小さいころは、よくひとりで遊んでたから。\nなんだか気になっちゃって、話しかけてみたんです。", "zh": "我小时候也经常一个人玩。所以不知怎么的就很在意，试着和她搭话了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "7f65b2b36e41c70a3acab8fe137d503ef1c2c6e45cd6117995b2947989b1fece", "ja": "それから、一緒に遊ぶようになったんですよ！\nねっ？", "zh": "后来，我们就一起玩了起来！\n对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1023_kenji", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "014ffeb7cb88c0ca11c3ca9f844453fdc529ab0f93a07a28864ffcb1f1d616b9", "ja": "歌を聞いてもらったり、枝で地面に絵を描いたり。\nお宝がないかな～って冒険したりもしました♪", "zh": "请别人听歌，或者用树枝在地上画画。\n还一起探险，看看能不能找到宝藏♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1025_049mom", "source_sha256": "fd266bf656632ee86bcac6f75cf44f3c4851ccc05d0b28f86651fa100a8ec32b", "ja": "ふーん。それで今日も、\nいっしょに遊ぶ約束をしてたんだ。", "zh": "嗯——所以今天也约好了要一起玩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "3e7915dcef5fa90044c36ed99caf07ef74f01ac15a8af890fb8ca7f519969a37", "ja": "どうした、元気がないな。\n……いつもこんな感じなのか？", "zh": "怎么了，无精打采的。\n……平时也总是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "d8149c73fb7fd030666b4657df24da50ffa9bd5c2018366777a7d1ab131c6135", "ja": "うーん。そんなことないんだけど……\nみんなに言っちゃっても大丈夫？", "zh": "嗯……倒也不是这样，只是……\n告诉大家也没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1029_kenji", "source_sha256": "1b8ebe2bed47470206ca750b44b34c834e68c6e6fb0701f964d7d4552afd26f9", "ja": "うん、別にいい……。", "zh": "嗯，也没什么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "d9fa4818a2598ea9c3340a0f0f3b1d1ef773b9291f4c65c0d5748bcd60aade4c", "ja": "わかった。……実は彼、お家の事情で、\nもうじき海外に引っ越しちゃうんです。", "zh": "我知道了。……其实他因为家里的原因，\n马上就要搬到国外去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "dcb2dcf17d07d96b191f8939a5e66340155f089ec5bc9f3559619e5d70824898", "ja": "だから、日本での思い出をいっぱい作ろうって、\n私ともたくさん遊んでもらってるんですよ♪", "zh": "所以，我想让他在日本留下许多回忆，\n最近也经常陪我一起玩呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "1e9acb40511d985375efdfb75f523b0338f152a679122c035459de5f09f5f03a", "ja": "そういうことだったのか……\nいろいろ納得したよ。", "zh": "原来是这么回事……\n很多事情都说得通了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "4d6227cf438cbf524d8c763350786095e1b23838dc8fc396076651d30eac1990", "ja": "なら、ウチらも混ぜてもらっていいか？\nせっかくだ、みんなで思い出を作ろうぜ。", "zh": "既然这样，那我们也可以加入吗？\n难得有这个机会，大家一起留下回忆吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1034_014mir", "source_sha256": "f6a0b0d6061ea0ee5c5a526d08d371c266dadf7f64c3e2054a5f8fd9b82b177d", "ja": "わぁ、いいですね♪\nねえねえケンジくん、私たちとも遊んでくれる？", "zh": "哇，好棒啊♪\n呐呐，健司君，你也愿意和我们一起玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1035_kenji", "source_sha256": "c6360164d451fe23afaba57fb230b952ac20bb60f3538d210f01126cb17b3e80", "ja": "……麗花お姉ちゃん……。", "zh": "……丽花姐姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "5a16b7939a81edfa95f12d025ce21c0faab5e8d0f0e4f88811e6a036dfbc781e", "ja": "うん。ケンジ君がいいなら、私は大歓迎だよ♪", "zh": "嗯。只要健二觉得可以，我非常欢迎哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1037_kenji", "source_sha256": "a499c1e41d1205f2e88f1b870047190b8795abaaee7c1b98178e8186f9b7a3bb", "ja": "わかった……。いいよ。", "zh": "知道了……可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1038_048rei", "source_sha256": "48544ec45089a42254b6d5fc12d230d30fe44404d43b0c51d2852be5404cdecc", "ja": "わーい、大人数になりましたね！　だったら、\n私たちだけじゃできないような遊びがいいよね？", "zh": "好耶，人变多了呢！既然这样，就来玩些光靠我们可玩不成的游戏吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1039_048rei", "source_sha256": "cac2292e5936e0f550c498d6cd74c4cf0bb788f343fe3c4970253d5ddbe4507e", "ja": "鬼ごっこはどうかな？\n鬼はもちろん、{$P$}さんで♪", "zh": "捉鬼游戏怎么样？鬼当然要由{$P$}先生来当♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1040_p", "source_sha256": "c587e54d55320f96965664f243332e08297f49ff597ef34b9d4481d899a136bf", "ja": "もちろんってどういう事だ？", "zh": "什么叫“当然”啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1041_048rei", "source_sha256": "624a5a4aa2867a4d92433da7184e96e6d351afcb10a18bdd3f649ebe7a238923", "ja": "アイドルを追いかけるのは、得意かなって♪\n頑張ってください、鬼デューサーさん♪", "zh": "我想，我还是挺擅长追偶像的♪  \n加油哦，鬼制作人先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1042_049mom", "source_sha256": "a1030c91b1d0c81ed9bd87bc593025800871ba7f2f50fb06babfd1f7ca2e913b", "ja": "いいね。相手がお兄ちゃんなら、\n桃子も本気出して逃げるよ♪", "zh": "不错。要是对手是哥哥的话，\n桃子也会认真逃跑哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1043_014mir", "source_sha256": "0d9c871f01adb2c17026291596ba9eb021a6e497c89a1bcddb2c4fc5c2c82136", "ja": "よ～し、私も逃げますよ～！\n{$P$}さん、がんばってください！", "zh": "好～的，我也要逃跑啦～！\n{$P$}先生，加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1044_p", "source_sha256": "6845a617273f677faf24304cd57998d45dc5efdb43ad32edfc8814786bc9c79e", "ja": "仕方ないな……\nよし、気合いを入れて追いかけるぞ！", "zh": "没办法了……\n\n好，打起精神追上去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1045_052kao", "source_sha256": "0e381dbdd3a35483df903e82cb59d4d4955b73f6a311fd4eee0f18467ba2c98f", "ja": "けど、{$P$}さんひとりじゃ……\nあの、私も鬼になって、お手伝いしましょうか？", "zh": "不过，光靠{$P$}先生一个人……那个，要不我也变成鬼来帮忙吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1046_050jul", "source_sha256": "30dd5aeb4cd7a0376392b1149aa18660d0619d834ec637b79dabaffb6dcbd1ac", "ja": "いいんだよ、カオリ。ウチらアイドルと違って、\n{$P$}は万年運動不足だろ？", "zh": "没事啦，歌织。和我们这些偶像不一样，{$P$}一直都缺乏运动，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1047_050jul", "source_sha256": "26520a2a58de66b20ed7fba0c91721eb5f65a8f7da4a80fdee93259c2bc9c4ad", "ja": "いい機会だと思って、ウチらを追いかけてくれ。\nじゃあな♪", "zh": "就当是个好机会，来追我们吧。\n回见啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1048_se", "source_sha256": "5eb294583bc6f40ad4e1df90eb85c503fc9ab6b6afb330bcf1c8be5b6f361216", "ja": "タッタッタ……", "zh": "哒哒哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1049_048rei", "source_sha256": "2dd6857eb662c7df2e12fa3b084d0f98905fe28c3e60508c112b506347880dd8", "ja": "100数え終えたら、追いかけてきてくださいね。\nケンジくん、私たちもびゅんびゅん逃げちゃおう♪", "zh": "数到100之后，请来追我们哦。\n健二君，我们也嗖嗖地逃走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1050_kenji", "source_sha256": "f567be4672d3a0f45ea17048d933539d90189c93e09da159b2c67a3d32f77d15", "ja": "うん……\nお兄ちゃん、がんばって……！", "zh": "嗯……\n大哥哥，加油……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1051_se", "source_sha256": "5eb294583bc6f40ad4e1df90eb85c503fc9ab6b6afb330bcf1c8be5b6f361216", "ja": "タッタッタ……", "zh": "哒哒哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1052_p", "source_sha256": "e42177c81a20a5b9cf00f0a46139203d6d9a268f6b64e0034259015d89f22c02", "ja": "蜘蛛の子を散らすように、みんな逃げていったな。\n数えなくてもいい気がするけど……1、2、3……。", "zh": "大家像一窝蜂似的四散逃开了。感觉不用数也没关系，不过……1、2、3……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1054_p", "source_sha256": "f79e2d9d87e684ad65cc1ab74042eb0e7b07483f1fbe9d4c53aa13458e078868", "ja": "（それからみんなで、鬼ごっこ、陣地とり、\n缶蹴りなどいろんな遊びをした）", "zh": "（之后，大家一起玩了捉鬼、抢地盘、踢罐子等各种游戏）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1055_p", "source_sha256": "0ca9020eecc042c4a74493ed5bf04d4c631d6751e6ec61d71586a73a54371090", "ja": "（こんなに走り回ったのは久しぶりだな。\n明日、筋肉痛にならないといいんだけど……）", "zh": "（这么到处跑来跑去还是久违了。希望明天不会肌肉酸痛就好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1056_kenji", "source_sha256": "4073ae9c9eef01bf848bd542c291193fd60cf4229545d3eea4434df29453a37f", "ja": "……麗花お姉ちゃん。\nボク、そろそろ帰らなくちゃ……。", "zh": "……丽花姐姐。\n我差不多该回去了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1057_048rei", "source_sha256": "b01c9e7df7b25e4c8455dd573b4f9398900de6de11148926b1fe6117482d9ac6", "ja": "そっか、夕方だもんね。\nあーあ、時間が操れたらいいのにな～。", "zh": "这样啊，已经傍晚了呢。\n啊——要是能操纵时间就好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1058_048rei", "source_sha256": "6fbeb5cef76f2cb41a9a47b0327b7b75b08432791893a375cab240dc3aa4526f", "ja": "そしたら、楽しい時間をす～っごく長くして、\nずっと遊んでいられるようにしちゃうのにね。", "zh": "那样的话，就能把快乐的时光拉得～长长的，一直玩下去了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1059_kenji", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1060_048rei", "source_sha256": "070878cf208340ee3210c0d26f37b743e55d2e3e69eb1e8285ff98bbae7de463", "ja": "あ、そうだ。これを渡さなくちゃだったんだ。\n……はい！", "zh": "啊，对了。差点忘了要把这个交给你。\n……给！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1061_p", "source_sha256": "36f7c16df90cfccc3738daf744f132d9ff0b751764cda2aef1f4665424669f49", "ja": "封筒……？", "zh": "信封……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1062_048rei", "source_sha256": "107c06b58a652443d264c82701ffb0d30ea2a4e6f51d5bde251a6dbbe7288f5d", "ja": "私たちの、公演のチケット！　次の公演は、\n私がセンターなんだよ。ぱちぱちぱち～♪", "zh": "是我们演出的票！下次的演出，\n我会担任中心哦。鼓掌鼓掌鼓掌～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1063_048rei", "source_sha256": "9265d1a1e0ade1d4709440846030da7d8725773b219fc6645000d0013469c618", "ja": "ここにいるみんなで一生懸命盛り上げるから、\nケンジ君にも来てもらえると嬉しいな♪", "zh": "我们会和在场的大家一起努力把气氛炒热，所以要是健司君也能来，我会很开心的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1064_kenji", "source_sha256": "d41ce6797be1b00f02936604800086000433e83532ebd8a2cbb6387d20a6ad4b", "ja": "うん……ぜったい、行く！", "zh": "嗯……我一定去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1065_kenji", "source_sha256": "19313142929b3b2d48221a7590740f2c9a16499c005ac86cc53752740c046032", "ja": "ありがとう、麗花お姉ちゃん。\nまたね……バイバイ！", "zh": "谢谢丽花姐姐。\n下次见……拜拜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1066_048rei", "source_sha256": "90ee4d8dba23087e4a5900eb014d1791ade5501c4c3303d50d0368a7664771b4", "ja": "ばいばーい！\nお家まで、気をつけて帰ってね～♪", "zh": "拜拜——！\n回家的路上要小心哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1067_048rei", "source_sha256": "b570e982386d071bbfee0cdab81621b26525e144696da615a835007ef84d884f", "ja": "……みんな、今日は本当にありがとう♪\nあの子、今まで見たことがないくらい喜んでたよ。", "zh": "……大家，今天真的非常感谢你们♪\n那孩子高兴得不得了，简直是我以前从没见过的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1068_049mom", "source_sha256": "9f2226b1d34b3b8c39e9b465ca2aa4818e10482b4672a0dfe635b4bdf5a86769", "ja": "あれで喜んでたの？\n桃子には、そうは見えなかったけど……。", "zh": "他那样就高兴了吗？\n桃子可没看出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1069_048rei", "source_sha256": "546271d618667dcc51d310f804202683d8e6d94fe0283d454595a1a0c0d5c700", "ja": "ふふ。ケンジ君は、とっても照れ屋さんだから♪\nでもでも、喜んでたのは間違いないよ。", "zh": "呵呵。健司可是非常害羞的男孩子呢♪\n不过不过，他开心了这点是肯定没错的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1070_048rei", "source_sha256": "6a457658062faf297279695bb2168834854cfd5ea40dd0d0699e72efeb989d16", "ja": "遊んでる時、「楽しいね」って、\n何度も私に笑いかけてくれたし。", "zh": "玩的时候，他还对我笑了好多次，说着“真开心啊”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1071_048rei", "source_sha256": "91b5c7224b7d8cb0024aa3848b0005374faa837394c0c8fac71fe0a7b416c241", "ja": "でも、もっともっと笑顔にしたいな～。\nとびきりの笑顔になってほしいな～！って。", "zh": "不过，我还想让你露出更多更多的笑容～  \n希望你能露出最灿烂的笑容～！我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1072_p", "source_sha256": "366ea953b35345bcd75407396e0a259a3c826e02b587caf183cb4b299c606b98", "ja": "だから、今度の公演に招待したのか？", "zh": "所以，你才邀请她参加这次公演的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1073_048rei", "source_sha256": "52610fb322972dd0c459c28c5129e23aff2680dad660006e41fefa90bbd7888f", "ja": "はい！　あっ、もちろんあの子だけじゃなくて。\n来てくれた人みんなが、笑顔になっちゃうような……。", "zh": "是的！啊，当然不只是邀请那孩子。\n我想让每一位到场的人都能露出笑容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_104_1074_048rei", "source_sha256": "573d3f6dbbfdb93f0b64434c249637fc28f299f845ef70cb49c2dbf22ec9e72d", "ja": "そんな、楽しい公演にしたいなーって思ってます！\nでもでも、私だけじゃ無理かもしれないから……。", "zh": "我想把公演办得这么开心——！\n不过不过，光靠我一个人可能不行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
